I extracted the numbers myself from the NAO web pages; what I've done
here[*] was...
1. get playerlist from http://alt.org/nethack/mostascensions.html
2. for each player with rank 1 to 500 in playerlist get
    http://alt.org/nethack/player-stats.php?player=${player}
3. build slices of players to average the peaks; the data I
    mentioned had slices of 25 players and increments of 5
    (i.e. players 1-25, 6-30, 11-35, 16-40, ...)
4. for each player slice calculate average numbers (number of
    class ascended per class played)

[*] In the past I inspected already the record file to obtain numbers.

